1
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,300
They have deceived the descendant of a hero,

2
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,300
to unknowingly dirty his own hands.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,200
Taking Wang Lun's neck is a simple task.

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,000
Please wait a moment longer.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,300
Chao Gai is
the Pagoda-Shifting Heavenly King.

6
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,380
Kill him.

7
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,580
4,000 soldiers
have been deployed from Beijing.

8
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,670
They aim for your neck, Chao Gai.

9
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,250
You will be killed.

10
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:28,020
It is a gamble I am willing to take.

11
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:30,400
I ask that you trust me, Song Jiang.

12
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:34,370
If I were Chao Gai,
there is only one place to escape to.

13
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:38,870
Clear a path for our future!

14
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,080
Halt.

15
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:20,270
Yes, sir?

16
00:01:22,525 --> 00:01:24,480
Your sleeves.

17
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,850
Pardon?

18
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:30,220
They are stained.

19
00:01:34,385 --> 00:01:38,270
My apologies, sir. I am but a clumsy man.

20
00:01:38,270 --> 00:01:39,710
Is that so.

21
00:01:56,215 --> 00:01:57,840
Li Fu.

22
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:00,670
A boat has made it across Liangshan Marsh.

23
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:03,505
Will Wang Lun allow Chao Gai to remain?

24
00:02:03,505 --> 00:02:08,689
If he is denied entry,
we shall take his neck.

25
00:02:08,689 --> 00:02:12,250
However, Wang Lun will lose his men's trust.

26
00:02:12,250 --> 00:02:14,660
All will depend on Wang Lun's decision.

27
00:02:15,550 --> 00:02:17,190
Does something bother you, sir?

28
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,190
His right sleeve was stained as well.

29
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,420
[Episode 6]

30
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:41,270
I am the Pagoda-Shifting Heavenly King.

31
00:03:43,455 --> 00:03:45,851
I have come,

32
00:03:45,851 --> 00:03:51,330
hearing this place is a haven
for those with qualms against this nation.

33
00:03:51,330 --> 00:03:55,290
We must allow the Pagoda-Shifting
Heavenly King to enter, sir.

34
00:03:55,290 --> 00:03:57,330
Hold your tongue.

35
00:03:57,330 --> 00:03:59,990
I am rethinking my earlier decision.

36
00:03:59,990 --> 00:04:03,650
If we allow him entrance,
we must fight the imperial army.

37
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:07,210
Sir, though they are an army of 4,000,

38
00:04:07,210 --> 00:04:09,990
they have no ships to cross this marsh.

39
00:04:09,990 --> 00:04:14,595
We cannot be fighting the nation's army.

40
00:04:14,595 --> 00:04:18,815
Then you must make
the declaration yourself, sir.

41
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:23,180
Why? It is no obligation of mine
to confront those men.

42
00:04:26,850 --> 00:04:29,720
Lin Chong, what are your thoughts?

43
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,460
You ought to know more about this army.

44
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:36,560
I was merely an instructor
for the Imperial Guard.

45
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:40,760
Do your loyalties lie elsewhere after all?

46
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:43,395
You suspect I am a dog of the Imperial Guard?

47
00:04:43,395 --> 00:04:48,038
I gave you your chance to dispel my doubts,

48
00:04:48,038 --> 00:04:51,468
yet you allowed Yang Zhi to live.

49
00:04:52,345 --> 00:04:57,820
How distrustful must you be?

50
00:04:57,820 --> 00:05:01,520
Then prove yourself to me, Lin Chong!

51
00:05:02,855 --> 00:05:05,660
You are a pitiable man.

52
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:08,885
You do not trust a single soul.

53
00:05:08,885 --> 00:05:12,080
You order your men to remain unarmed.

54
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:18,390
All while you stay protected
behind your two guards.

55
00:05:19,910 --> 00:05:25,230
You dare disrespect me, Lin Chong?

56
00:05:53,935 --> 00:06:00,080
I, Chao Gai of Yuncheng,
as well as six others,

57
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:03,295
have come to Liangshan
with 10,000 pieces of treasure

58
00:06:03,295 --> 00:06:07,825
meant for a chancellor in Kaifeng.

59
00:06:09,335 --> 00:06:11,150
Look here.

60
00:06:11,150 --> 00:06:15,980
This is the sullied loot
that was to be delivered to Cai Jing.

61
00:06:18,935 --> 00:06:23,650
He's captured the hearts of these hooligans
in an instant.

62
00:06:23,650 --> 00:06:27,370
Now Wang Lun cannot chase us away so easily.

63
00:06:37,595 --> 00:06:42,470
We have plundered the rich
in the name of honor,

64
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:45,460
and are now being chased
by the imperial army.

65
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:48,280
I request protection for the seven of us.

66
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:51,800
Will your leader Wang Lun uphold his honor,

67
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,740
and fight the imperial forces?

68
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:59,615
Or will he chase us away,
and take their side?

69
00:06:59,615 --> 00:07:02,705
That is what I wish to know.

70
00:07:03,690 --> 00:07:06,380
Who among you is Chao Gai?

71
00:07:10,915 --> 00:07:13,190
You are speaking to him now.

72
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:16,980
Are those the bribes you have stolen?

73
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:18,436
Indeed.

74
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:25,390
We have not lain a finger
on these stolen treasures.

75
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:31,010
We instead hope to use them for the people.

76
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:37,540
And to that end, we hope you will aid us.

77
00:07:39,425 --> 00:07:44,010
I respect your honorable soul, Chao Gai.

78
00:07:44,010 --> 00:07:49,395
However, we of Liangshan
have our own rules to follow.

79
00:07:49,395 --> 00:07:53,305
I alone cannot make the decision
to allow your stay.

80
00:07:54,892 --> 00:07:59,490
I shall consult my men.
Await our verdict in the parlor.

81
00:07:59,490 --> 00:08:00,927
We shall offer you liquor.

82
00:08:00,927 --> 00:08:02,816
Thank you, but I shall decline.

83
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:08,140
My men and I will wait right here.

84
00:08:14,835 --> 00:08:19,940
What a troublesome bunch indeed.

85
00:08:19,940 --> 00:08:22,400
What shall we do?

86
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:26,230
We cannot make a hasty decision.

87
00:08:26,230 --> 00:08:28,460
If any sympathize with Chao Gai and his men,

88
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:31,130
the imperial army will seize this place.

89
00:08:31,130 --> 00:08:34,250
Do you fear the imperial army?

90
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:37,195
We must first strengthen our troops.

91
00:08:37,195 --> 00:08:42,905
By continuing to attack innocents
and their cargo?

92
00:08:44,015 --> 00:08:46,490
I have my ways.

93
00:08:46,490 --> 00:08:48,090
Then will you kill these men?

94
00:08:48,090 --> 00:08:51,350
You heard the support they garnered.

95
00:08:51,350 --> 00:08:55,355
Kill them, and we will lose all power here.

96
00:08:55,355 --> 00:08:57,775
Then what is our next move?

97
00:09:02,045 --> 00:09:04,590
Tell them our fortress is full.

98
00:09:04,590 --> 00:09:06,280
We cannot harbor any more men here.

99
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:11,970
You will chase them out with their treasures,

100
00:09:11,970 --> 00:09:14,310
to evade conflict with the imperial army?

101
00:09:14,310 --> 00:09:16,330
Yes.

102
00:09:16,330 --> 00:09:18,145
Are you absolutely certain, sir?

103
00:09:18,145 --> 00:09:20,155
My decision is final.

104
00:09:41,670 --> 00:09:44,850
When we are ready,

105
00:09:44,850 --> 00:09:47,970
I will wear a black obi.

106
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:52,130
That will be your cue.

107
00:09:59,420 --> 00:10:01,150
Wang Lun.

108
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:04,610
You fear the imperial army.

109
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:09,020
You trample on the hearts of honorable men.

110
00:10:09,655 --> 00:10:12,080
You even reject their treasures.

111
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:14,800
What does that make this stronghold?

112
00:10:16,515 --> 00:10:20,050
Was this not a haven for like-minded souls?

113
00:10:20,050 --> 00:10:23,390
A fortress, for those who share a heart?

114
00:10:24,465 --> 00:10:27,670
You've shown your true colors, Lin Chong.

115
00:10:27,670 --> 00:10:31,100
Kill him. Kill him!

116
00:10:50,570 --> 00:10:52,940
Discard your weapons!

117
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:50,000
You have done well, Lin Chong.

118
00:11:51,365 --> 00:11:53,330
It was my honor, sir.

119
00:11:53,330 --> 00:11:56,225
Rumors are beginning to spread.

120
00:11:56,225 --> 00:12:01,835
We must swiftly declare our victory,
and Wang Lun's death to the 3,000 others.

121
00:12:28,667 --> 00:12:34,227
He was a pitiful man.

122
00:12:35,370 --> 00:12:40,640
He once rallied the hearts of you men.

123
00:12:41,540 --> 00:12:44,390
At a time, I do not doubt
he was a venerable leader.

124
00:12:45,420 --> 00:12:50,390
Yet he unfortunately lost sight of his ways.

125
00:13:00,945 --> 00:13:05,770
I will have to make a show
of Wang Lun's head.

126
00:13:05,770 --> 00:13:11,450
But my intent is not to shame him.

127
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:16,890
Rather, it is to warn the rest of his fate.

128
00:13:18,535 --> 00:13:21,010
Am I clear?

129
00:13:21,010 --> 00:13:22,460
Yes, sir.

130
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:42,990
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

131
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:48,380
The rain and dark clouds have now passed.

132
00:13:49,286 --> 00:13:54,826
We are all comrades,
enforcing the way in Heaven's name.

133
00:13:59,710 --> 00:14:01,430
We are rogues.

134
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:08,200
We cannot abide by the rules
of those in Kaifeng.

135
00:14:08,947 --> 00:14:13,757
We have the strength to fight.

136
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:19,290
We can save our people
who are oppressed by those in power.

137
00:14:20,710 --> 00:14:26,970
This fortress shall be a perch
for those who save the weak.

138
00:14:28,870 --> 00:14:32,720
For those who look to the same blue skies.

139
00:14:35,330 --> 00:14:38,100
I now call this land, Mount Liang.

140
00:15:11,130 --> 00:15:13,270
Mount Liang.

141
00:15:14,590 --> 00:15:16,360
A wonderful name indeed.

142
00:15:21,125 --> 00:15:23,830
He was no mere rabbit after all.

143
00:15:23,830 --> 00:15:25,190
Indeed.

144
00:15:25,190 --> 00:15:27,525
My presence is no longer of use.

145
00:15:27,525 --> 00:15:29,225
I will return to the capital at once.

146
00:15:32,345 --> 00:15:34,900
Remain here, and continue your observations.

147
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:36,380
Yes, sir.

148
00:15:40,965 --> 00:15:43,290
Another salt road was extinguished?

149
00:15:43,290 --> 00:15:47,260
Yes, sir. They are
becoming difficult to maintain.

150
00:15:47,260 --> 00:15:50,310
Though we may excavate mountains
and procure our own supply,

151
00:15:50,310 --> 00:15:55,580
if we have no modes of transport,
then they are merely sitting stock.

152
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:57,870
This is quite dire.

153
00:15:57,870 --> 00:16:02,565
Those associated with the smuggling
are becoming known as well.

154
00:16:02,565 --> 00:16:07,625
Then perhaps it is time
we exchange our managing parties.

155
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,800
Deng Li Hua.

156
00:16:14,705 --> 00:16:17,050
Yes, Master Lu?

157
00:16:17,050 --> 00:16:18,115
[Deng Li Hua, Lu Jun Yi's retainer]

158
00:16:18,115 --> 00:16:20,185
I am sure you heard.

159
00:16:23,525 --> 00:16:30,290
You will temporarily be removed
from overseeing our salt roads.

160
00:16:30,290 --> 00:16:33,210
What shall I do in the meanwhile?

161
00:16:33,210 --> 00:16:37,170
I have lost a path of communication
with Song Jiang.

162
00:16:37,170 --> 00:16:39,210
I ask that you be our messenger

163
00:16:39,210 --> 00:16:43,775
by acting as Song Jiang's mistress.

164
00:16:43,775 --> 00:16:47,840
A mistress of Sir Song Jiang...

165
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:50,090
Do you find issue with this?

166
00:16:51,725 --> 00:16:54,330
No, I am fine.

167
00:16:54,330 --> 00:16:57,266
You have raised me like your own kin.

168
00:16:57,266 --> 00:17:02,000
Any way I can repay you is an honor.

169
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:08,580
It vexes me that I cannot do a thing,

170
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:13,925
while Sir Chao Gai puts his life in danger.

171
00:17:13,925 --> 00:17:16,485
Make no mistake. Our battle lies here.

172
00:17:17,255 --> 00:17:19,660
Yan Qing.

173
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:23,180
This is our battlefield,
and money is my weapon.

174
00:17:26,235 --> 00:17:31,960
We shall protect Chao Gai
with these weapons of ours.

175
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,540
A weapon...

176
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:43,370
We had two days of heavy rain.

177
00:17:44,356 --> 00:17:52,971
I was worried you let yourself
be swept up by the stream.

178
00:17:53,975 --> 00:17:58,950
But I see you are alive and well, Shi Jin.

179
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:16,040
Father.

180
00:18:18,650 --> 00:18:22,930
You left before I could
give anything in return.

181
00:18:23,990 --> 00:18:26,840
That itself, is another sin.

182
00:18:30,415 --> 00:18:32,330
Young master!

183
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:34,355
The outlaws of Mount Shaohua!

184
00:18:34,355 --> 00:18:36,815
They have finally sprung their attack!

185
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:39,490
Please, hurry!

186
00:18:53,975 --> 00:18:56,200
Shi Jin, the Nine Tattooed Dragons.

187
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:59,340
I insist you allow us passage
through your family village.

188
00:19:00,555 --> 00:19:02,760
Never.

189
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:06,000
You still choose to block our path?

190
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:09,250
Master Wang Jin...

191
00:19:10,475 --> 00:19:14,420
I will be alive within you.

192
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:16,510
I know it to be true.

193
00:19:17,825 --> 00:19:20,930
If you are set on hindering our way,

194
00:19:20,930 --> 00:19:24,180
then I, Chen Da, the Stream-leaping Tiger,

195
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:26,585
shall take my iron spear

196
00:19:26,585 --> 00:19:31,205
and pierce you where you stand.
[Chen Da, Mount Shaohua bandit]

197
00:19:58,090 --> 00:20:00,310
Shi Jin, the Nine Tattooed Dragons.

198
00:20:01,055 --> 00:20:05,130
I only wish to pass your village
to defeat corrupt officials.

199
00:20:05,130 --> 00:20:07,880
Do you take their side?

200
00:20:09,665 --> 00:20:12,330
I am only defending my village from bandits!

201
00:20:12,330 --> 00:20:15,841
Who are the real bandits, Shi Jin?

202
00:20:15,841 --> 00:20:21,101
Is it not the officials
who so boldly steal from their people?

203
00:20:24,750 --> 00:20:26,840
Enough.

204
00:20:27,570 --> 00:20:29,850
I'll silence you myself!

205
00:20:31,205 --> 00:20:33,420
Shi Jin, the Nine Tattooed Dragons.

206
00:20:33,420 --> 00:20:37,820
Did Wang Jin teach you
to take a life for such reasons?

207
00:20:38,815 --> 00:20:42,580
Yes, you bested this man in combat.

208
00:20:42,580 --> 00:20:47,960
But his words triumph over yours.

209
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,910
Who are you?

210
00:20:49,910 --> 00:20:52,080
I am known as Lu Zhi Shen.

211
00:20:52,080 --> 00:20:55,435
I am a friend of Wang Jin.

212
00:20:55,435 --> 00:21:00,465
I came to deliver his letter,
only to come across this commotion.

213
00:21:01,605 --> 00:21:05,150
Shi Jin, you are getting heated.

214
00:21:05,150 --> 00:21:09,350
Calm yourself.

215
00:21:24,820 --> 00:21:28,350
[Shi Jin]

216
00:21:37,575 --> 00:21:42,240
[Venture out into the world.]

217
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:46,880
[Search for the meaning in your martial arts]

218
00:21:56,275 --> 00:21:58,250
Shi Jin!

219
00:21:58,250 --> 00:22:00,810
Shi Jin, the Nine Tattooed Dragons!

220
00:22:05,295 --> 00:22:07,500
Again with the yelling?

221
00:22:07,500 --> 00:22:11,230
Your home is quite rambunctious, Shi Jin.

222
00:22:16,825 --> 00:22:19,310
Chen Da, you are alive!

223
00:22:19,310 --> 00:22:20,625
Brothers...

224
00:22:20,625 --> 00:22:23,285
State your names.

225
00:22:23,285 --> 00:22:25,762
I am Zhu Wu.
[Zhu Wu, Chen Da's sworn brother]

226
00:22:25,762 --> 00:22:27,924
This is Yang Chun.
[Yang Chun, Chen Da's sworn brother]

227
00:22:28,596 --> 00:22:30,826
We are his sworn brothers.

228
00:22:31,555 --> 00:22:34,110
I am glad our younger brother is well.

229
00:22:34,110 --> 00:22:38,810
For if he were dead,
we would take our lives as well.

230
00:22:41,975 --> 00:22:46,400
Why must you also die if he were dead?

231
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:53,275
The three of us are one whole,
who make up for the other's faults.

232
00:22:53,275 --> 00:23:00,385
If even one of us perishes,
we will revert to mere bandits.

233
00:23:03,750 --> 00:23:08,210
Please, do not kill our younger brother.

234
00:23:19,270 --> 00:23:21,720
Three as one, is it?

235
00:23:24,815 --> 00:23:28,250
What about Wang Jin enamored you?

236
00:23:28,250 --> 00:23:30,330
Was it his strength alone?

237
00:23:48,275 --> 00:23:51,310
Return to your brothers.

238
00:23:51,310 --> 00:23:54,200
Chen Da!

239
00:23:56,920 --> 00:24:02,310
I implore you to visit us at Mount Shaohua.

240
00:24:03,360 --> 00:24:05,540
We'd like to share a drink with you.

241
00:24:43,620 --> 00:24:46,730
Why his mistress?

242
00:24:50,670 --> 00:24:53,706
What seems to be the matter?

243
00:24:53,706 --> 00:24:59,816
I have committed a grave sin.

244
00:25:01,315 --> 00:25:02,760
Not at all.

245
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:04,440
Deng Li Hua.

246
00:25:07,610 --> 00:25:09,900
What I have done is unforgivable.

247
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:22,550
This was my choice alone.

248
00:25:25,050 --> 00:25:27,780
Unforgivable as it may be.

249
00:25:57,665 --> 00:26:00,660
You play dirty! Are you another foe?

250
00:26:00,660 --> 00:26:03,740
The battlefield is unpredictable, sir.

251
00:26:03,740 --> 00:26:05,290
You are easily put off balance.

252
00:26:05,290 --> 00:26:07,485
You must strengthen your core.

253
00:26:07,485 --> 00:26:08,985
Like so.

254
00:26:10,515 --> 00:26:12,480
Again.

255
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:15,230
- Right.
- Go, Sir Song Jiang!

256
00:26:18,775 --> 00:26:21,040
Brother.

257
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:24,050
Qing, what brings you here today?

258
00:26:24,050 --> 00:26:25,560
[Song Qing, Song Jiang's younger brother]

259
00:26:25,560 --> 00:26:27,855
What are you doing?

260
00:26:27,855 --> 00:26:32,755
Oh, right. Qing, meet Zhu Tong, and Lei Heng.

261
00:26:34,455 --> 00:26:36,090
The name is Zhu Tong, sir.

262
00:26:36,090 --> 00:26:38,100
Though I was previously an Imperial Guard,
[Zhu Tong, Yuncheng Commander]

263
00:26:38,100 --> 00:26:41,750
I now lead Yuncheng's equestrian unit.
[Zhu Tong, Yuncheng Commander]

264
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:45,650
Your elder brother requested we train him.

265
00:26:45,650 --> 00:26:47,580
I am Lei Heng, sir.
[Lei Heng, Yuncheng Commander]

266
00:26:47,580 --> 00:26:50,645
It is a pleasure to meet you, Sir Song Qing.
[Lei Heng, Yuncheng Commander]

267
00:26:50,645 --> 00:26:52,685
I have heard much from your brother.

268
00:26:59,500 --> 00:27:01,980
This is Yan Po Xi.

269
00:27:04,320 --> 00:27:06,690
A new woman.

270
00:27:07,765 --> 00:27:10,840
Does your lust know no shame?

271
00:27:10,840 --> 00:27:13,390
- You've brought in another woman!
- "Another"?

272
00:27:13,390 --> 00:27:16,985
Qing, training would do good for you.
How about it?

273
00:27:16,985 --> 00:27:18,595
Brother.

274
00:27:19,370 --> 00:27:21,170
I, Song Qing,

275
00:27:22,340 --> 00:27:24,610
have made love to Deng Li Hua.

276
00:27:30,115 --> 00:27:33,790
Perhaps we'd best get going, Zhu Tong.

277
00:27:33,790 --> 00:27:36,230
Yan Po Xi, come along.

278
00:27:36,230 --> 00:27:37,370
Let us leave them.

279
00:27:37,370 --> 00:27:39,200
Zhu Tong, hurry.

280
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:42,225
- Yan Po Xi!
- Sir Song Jiang!

281
00:27:42,225 --> 00:27:44,405
- Come along now.
- Brother?

282
00:27:48,500 --> 00:27:50,190
I see.

283
00:27:51,335 --> 00:27:52,930
That is great news.

284
00:27:52,930 --> 00:27:54,910
Great news?

285
00:27:54,910 --> 00:27:58,570
Your own brother
has made love to your mistress!

286
00:27:58,570 --> 00:28:02,010
Qing, I must head to my office.

287
00:28:02,010 --> 00:28:03,230
Let us discuss this another time.

288
00:28:03,230 --> 00:28:05,420
Brother, I have had enough.

289
00:28:05,420 --> 00:28:07,770
You do not tell me a thing.

290
00:28:07,770 --> 00:28:11,475
I only learn of things after the fact.

291
00:28:11,475 --> 00:28:13,575
Brother!

292
00:28:24,690 --> 00:28:27,940
I cannot get you involved, Qing.

293
00:28:29,740 --> 00:28:31,390
Forgive me.

294
00:28:33,120 --> 00:28:34,320
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

295
00:28:44,190 --> 00:28:46,200
I am establishing a country.

296
00:28:52,205 --> 00:28:57,550
We will begin the process

297
00:28:57,550 --> 00:29:00,945
by organizing several chains of command.

298
00:29:00,945 --> 00:29:03,165
- Wu Yong.
- Yes, sir.

299
00:29:05,460 --> 00:29:07,400
Lin Chong.

300
00:29:08,635 --> 00:29:09,830
Yes, sir.

301
00:29:09,830 --> 00:29:13,410
You will command 300 equestrian soldiers

302
00:29:13,410 --> 00:29:15,425
as part of Mount Liang's equestrian unit.

303
00:29:15,425 --> 00:29:18,185
Train them well.

304
00:29:20,560 --> 00:29:23,330
[Lin Chong]

305
00:29:27,975 --> 00:29:29,440
Yes, sir.

306
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:33,460
Next, we will establish five infantry units,

307
00:29:33,460 --> 00:29:36,471
comprised of 1,500 soldiers total.

308
00:29:36,471 --> 00:29:37,971
Du Qian.

309
00:29:39,910 --> 00:29:41,320
Song Wan.

310
00:29:43,095 --> 00:29:44,980
Ruan Xiao Wu.

311
00:29:44,980 --> 00:29:46,710
Jiao Ting.

312
00:29:46,710 --> 00:29:49,405
Kong Ming. You five will lead these troops.

313
00:29:49,405 --> 00:29:51,790
Gongsun Sheng.
[Gongsun Sheng]

314
00:29:51,790 --> 00:29:54,830
You will expand your Zhisi Squad
from 50, to 300.

315
00:29:54,830 --> 00:29:57,190
Gongsun Sheng will remain commander.

316
00:29:57,190 --> 00:30:04,680
Shi Xiu, Kong Liang, Liu Tang,
and Yang Xiong will be your captains.

317
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:05,740
Yes, sir.

318
00:30:05,740 --> 00:30:08,355
Those who wish to join the Zhisi Squadron

319
00:30:08,355 --> 00:30:12,375
must truly understand what their job entails.

320
00:30:14,725 --> 00:30:20,440
We will also establish a Civil Unit
to write, and enact our laws.

321
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:24,040
Xiao Rang, Jin Da Jian,
you will forge documents for us.

322
00:30:24,040 --> 00:30:25,780
"Forge documents"?

323
00:30:25,780 --> 00:30:29,621
Intel is oftentimes more crucial
than sheer manpower.

324
00:30:29,621 --> 00:30:34,751
If we are able to forge commands,
we can confuse our enemies.

325
00:30:36,605 --> 00:30:40,540
We must also establish a naval fleet.

326
00:30:40,540 --> 00:30:42,710
Ruan Xiao Er. Ruan Xiao Qi.

327
00:30:42,710 --> 00:30:45,210
You two will command our ships.

328
00:30:45,210 --> 00:30:49,641
Mount Liang's strength
is in the marsh which surrounds it.

329
00:30:49,641 --> 00:30:54,761
Your expertise as fishermen
will prove crucial to our defense.

330
00:30:56,860 --> 00:30:58,490
An Dao Quan.

331
00:31:00,450 --> 00:31:02,020
An Dao Quan?

332
00:31:04,165 --> 00:31:08,210
He is in the clinic,
making medicines with Xue Yong.

333
00:31:08,210 --> 00:31:11,605
An Dao Quan and Xue Yong will run our clinic.

334
00:31:11,605 --> 00:31:13,475
Bai Sheng.

335
00:31:14,850 --> 00:31:20,770
You will be the bridge between us
and those medicine-obsessed doctors.

336
00:31:21,585 --> 00:31:23,520
Yes, sir.

337
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:26,929
Chai Jin will provide the logistics
of transporting our men and supplies.

338
00:31:26,929 --> 00:31:32,189
Zhu Gui will continue to hide our boats.

339
00:31:33,345 --> 00:31:39,470
I ask that he teaches our chefs
a thing or two as well.

340
00:31:39,470 --> 00:31:43,090
The food here tastes terrible at best.

341
00:31:44,845 --> 00:31:47,000
Leave it to me, sir.

342
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:49,200
To our smithies.

343
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:53,040
The population of Mount Liang will only grow.

344
00:31:53,040 --> 00:31:55,995
We will need farms and farmhouses for crops.

345
00:31:55,995 --> 00:31:58,485
[Chao Gai]

346
00:32:08,280 --> 00:32:14,960
[Mount Liang]

347
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:50,210
[Blacksmith]

348
00:32:55,570 --> 00:32:58,730
[Clinic]
[Examination Room]

349
00:33:03,630 --> 00:33:05,480
Here you go.

350
00:33:07,770 --> 00:33:09,400
Drink.

351
00:33:51,665 --> 00:33:54,930
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

352
00:33:54,930 --> 00:33:58,055
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

353
00:33:58,055 --> 00:34:01,495
[Assembly Hall]

354
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:10,100
[Song Jiang]

355
00:34:12,550 --> 00:34:14,250
Song Jiang.

356
00:34:15,030 --> 00:34:17,220
Come join me soon.

357
00:34:40,705 --> 00:34:42,900
Thank you.

358
00:34:42,900 --> 00:34:45,395
Sir... Song Jiang?

359
00:34:45,395 --> 00:34:47,505
Flowers...

360
00:34:48,230 --> 00:34:51,840
Sir Song Jiang...

361
00:35:55,515 --> 00:35:56,880
[Shi Xiu, Zhisi Squadron Captain]

362
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,860
Are these our potential recruits?

363
00:35:58,860 --> 00:36:00,260
Lin Chong.

364
00:36:00,260 --> 00:36:02,065
Gongsun Sheng.

365
00:36:02,065 --> 00:36:07,055
I have brought you men
worthy of the Zhisi Squadron.

366
00:36:09,325 --> 00:36:12,000
The Zhisi Squadron.

367
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:16,220
A squad faced with certain death.

368
00:36:22,170 --> 00:36:25,300
We do not desire fame, nor fortune.

369
00:36:26,475 --> 00:36:31,020
Our job sees no merit, nor promotions.

370
00:36:31,020 --> 00:36:33,275
We do not even leave a name behind.

371
00:36:33,275 --> 00:36:35,875
We do not think of living another day.

372
00:36:36,845 --> 00:36:40,790
We simply share a dream, and fight.

373
00:36:40,790 --> 00:36:44,990
Those who die, perish as unknowns.

374
00:36:44,990 --> 00:36:50,931
They will not live on in the people's hearts.

375
00:36:50,931 --> 00:36:55,281
However, I alone will not forget.

376
00:36:55,935 --> 00:37:00,950
We will not forget.

377
00:37:00,950 --> 00:37:08,115
Zhisi Squadron's men will live on
in each other's hearts.

378
00:37:08,115 --> 00:37:11,165
Those who take pride in such an end...

379
00:37:12,620 --> 00:37:14,430
Step forward,

380
00:37:16,070 --> 00:37:19,030
towards your imminent death.

381
00:37:47,500 --> 00:37:49,230
Your first task.

382
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:55,600
Scale this cliffside.

383
00:37:56,670 --> 00:37:58,270
Yes, sir.

384
00:38:18,995 --> 00:38:22,870
Defect, like I have.

385
00:38:22,870 --> 00:38:24,505
Leave, and you will find your path!

386
00:38:24,505 --> 00:38:29,035
Do you still defend
this utterly corrupt nation?

387
00:38:49,620 --> 00:38:51,430
Enough.

388
00:39:02,105 --> 00:39:04,380
That mark on your face.

389
00:39:04,380 --> 00:39:07,430
You must be Yang Zhi, the Blue-faced Beast.

390
00:39:08,765 --> 00:39:10,700
Who are you?

391
00:39:10,700 --> 00:39:12,440
Have you forgotten?

392
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:16,400
We once met at Lu Jun Yi's abode.

393
00:39:23,255 --> 00:39:24,920
You speak the truth?

394
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:28,130
Indeed. We had been searching for him.

395
00:39:28,130 --> 00:39:31,670
Thankfully, the Splitting Hairs Blade
stands out.

396
00:39:31,670 --> 00:39:33,330
How is he?

397
00:39:33,330 --> 00:39:37,875
Yang Zhi has lost his home, and his riches.

398
00:39:37,875 --> 00:39:41,785
If Yan Qing had not found him,
who knows what he would have done.

399
00:39:44,205 --> 00:39:47,586
We've wounded his self-esteem.

400
00:39:47,586 --> 00:39:54,096
If we had not ensnared him,
his overall worth was doomed to plummet.

401
00:39:55,310 --> 00:39:59,160
You speak like a true merchant.

402
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:06,650
If we left him be,
even a mere official could capture him.

403
00:40:08,580 --> 00:40:10,920
An official like myself, perhaps?

404
00:40:13,230 --> 00:40:15,210
Pardon me.

405
00:40:29,487 --> 00:40:35,507
We meet again, Yang Zhi,
the Blue-faced Beast.

406
00:40:38,510 --> 00:40:40,300
And you are?

407
00:40:42,555 --> 00:40:45,400
I am but a humble clerk.

408
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:47,550
But my name, is Song Jiang.

409
00:40:49,475 --> 00:40:51,650
Song Jiang...

410
00:40:51,650 --> 00:40:54,545
I have never seen an official
assist a peddler.

411
00:40:54,545 --> 00:40:55,587
What is your name?

412
00:40:55,587 --> 00:40:58,105
My name is Song Jiang.

413
00:40:58,105 --> 00:41:00,235
I am a local clerk.

414
00:41:03,160 --> 00:41:06,130
So you have come to capture me.

415
00:41:08,100 --> 00:41:09,650
No.

416
00:41:10,575 --> 00:41:15,210
I could never stand against
a strong man like yourself.

417
00:41:15,210 --> 00:41:20,760
Your Splitting Hairs Blade
would easily slice me in half.

418
00:41:22,060 --> 00:41:27,000
Then why have you come?

419
00:41:28,230 --> 00:41:33,200
There is something I would like to show you.

420
00:41:34,705 --> 00:41:41,450
Yang Zhi, would you join me
on an outing tomorrow?

421
00:41:52,120 --> 00:41:53,790
What is all this?

422
00:41:54,975 --> 00:41:57,440
The aftermath of a bandit attack?

423
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:59,040
Yes.

424
00:42:05,100 --> 00:42:06,790
Is there anyone alive?

425
00:42:10,165 --> 00:42:12,380
Anyone at all?

426
00:42:12,380 --> 00:42:14,290
They are all dead.

427
00:42:15,390 --> 00:42:17,250
Anyone?

428
00:42:19,215 --> 00:42:22,360
The Yuncheng Office
was notified of the attack three days ago.

429
00:42:22,360 --> 00:42:24,675
I only found out last night.

430
00:42:24,675 --> 00:42:27,400
The whole incident had been silenced.

431
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:29,320
Why?

432
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:31,520
Why do officials ignore these people in need?

433
00:42:31,520 --> 00:42:33,870
Because they receive no orders to send aid.

434
00:42:33,870 --> 00:42:35,860
No orders?

435
00:42:35,860 --> 00:42:38,222
Compared to us officials,

436
00:42:38,222 --> 00:42:42,730
bandits here triumph
in both numbers and strength.

437
00:42:42,730 --> 00:42:48,445
Take action, and incur the wrath
of the wrong bandit,

438
00:42:48,445 --> 00:42:51,650
and an official is sure
to lose any chance at a promotion.

439
00:42:51,650 --> 00:42:54,400
Then they are no better
than the bandits themselves!

440
00:42:55,625 --> 00:42:59,730
They sit in their homes,
enjoying their meals,

441
00:42:59,730 --> 00:43:02,765
all while the poor must suffer.

442
00:43:02,765 --> 00:43:05,155
How can they do such a thing?

443
00:43:10,660 --> 00:43:14,120
Soldiers only need to follow orders.

444
00:43:14,940 --> 00:43:15,805
What?

445
00:43:15,805 --> 00:43:19,210
I suspect that was your life's motto.

446
00:43:20,150 --> 00:43:22,580
And officials are the same.

447
00:43:25,983 --> 00:43:28,073
They obey their orders.

448
00:43:38,560 --> 00:43:43,450
How can you act so calm at a time like this?

449
00:43:48,060 --> 00:43:51,290
Do I look calm to you?

450
00:44:05,400 --> 00:44:07,955
What is it I should do?

451
00:44:07,955 --> 00:44:11,390
You were a man raised as a soldier,

452
00:44:11,390 --> 00:44:15,570
yet now you are without orders.

453
00:44:15,570 --> 00:44:18,675
You do not know what to do next.

454
00:44:18,675 --> 00:44:20,365
I suspect I am right?

455
00:44:27,190 --> 00:44:29,410
Do you have the answer to my conundrum?

456
00:44:33,400 --> 00:44:35,460
Can you not hear these cries?

457
00:44:36,440 --> 00:44:41,160
Though silent, the people are crying out.

458
00:44:42,400 --> 00:44:45,540
Their pleas ought to be your orders.

459
00:44:46,940 --> 00:44:50,590
The pleas of our people...

460
00:44:56,150 --> 00:44:58,970
We call this, the mandate of Heaven.

461
00:45:01,600 --> 00:45:04,120
Yang Zhi, the Blue-faced Beast.

462
00:45:40,455 --> 00:45:44,080
My apologies, Yuan Ming.

463
00:45:44,080 --> 00:45:46,500
Close call, I say.

464
00:45:58,360 --> 00:46:03,050
Drop the ball you kick, and you are no more.

465
00:46:11,125 --> 00:46:12,810
Tang Niu Er.

466
00:46:12,810 --> 00:46:14,130
Yes, sir.

467
00:46:28,120 --> 00:46:33,870
A secret organization spearheaded
by Chancellor Cai Jing, you say?

468
00:46:34,665 --> 00:46:36,350
Yes, sir.
[Shi Qian, Song Jiang's spy]

469
00:46:36,350 --> 00:46:39,950
They apprehended Lin Chong,
raised the price of salt,

470
00:46:39,950 --> 00:46:46,335
and ultimately deployed soldiers
to corner Chao Gai.

471
00:46:46,335 --> 00:46:51,705
Only a few in Kaifeng
know of this organization.

472
00:46:52,625 --> 00:46:56,310
And you said their name was...

473
00:46:56,310 --> 00:46:58,420
The Qinglian Temple.

474
00:47:00,715 --> 00:47:02,490
Qinglian Temple.

475
00:47:02,490 --> 00:47:05,475
Given they know Chao Gai
is the Pagoda-Shifting Heavenly King,

476
00:47:05,475 --> 00:47:09,225
our identities may be compromised as well.

477
00:47:11,795 --> 00:47:13,576
Halt.

478
00:47:13,576 --> 00:47:16,046
Your sleeves, they are stained.

479
00:47:23,650 --> 00:47:25,700
That man's glare.

480
00:47:26,440 --> 00:47:30,540
It sent quite the shiver down my spine.

481
00:47:31,276 --> 00:47:34,506
That indescribable gaze.

482
00:47:36,605 --> 00:47:39,520
Li Fu saw my face.

483
00:47:39,520 --> 00:47:42,625
Shi Qian, I must ask you a request.

484
00:47:42,625 --> 00:47:44,195
What is it, sir?

485
00:47:48,690 --> 00:47:51,737
Please deliver this letter to Ma Gui,

486
00:47:51,737 --> 00:47:56,015
and have her leave this line of work.

487
00:47:56,015 --> 00:48:01,150
If she continues as a spy,
her life will certainly be in danger.

488
00:48:01,150 --> 00:48:04,140
You care much for a mere spy like her.

489
00:48:06,480 --> 00:48:11,220
My words do not convince Ma Gui.

490
00:48:12,690 --> 00:48:16,750
I hope you can convince her,
from one spy to another.

491
00:48:17,600 --> 00:48:19,450
Yes, sir.

492
00:48:24,738 --> 00:48:26,763
Tang Niu Er.

493
00:48:26,763 --> 00:48:29,193
Miss Yan Po Xi!

494
00:48:30,055 --> 00:48:32,600
Why are you loitering about? It's hot today.

495
00:48:32,600 --> 00:48:34,560
They've chased me out.

496
00:48:34,560 --> 00:48:37,770
Secret talks and all.

497
00:48:37,770 --> 00:48:39,640
But look at your sweat...

498
00:48:39,640 --> 00:48:44,925
I am a servant. I am used to this treatment.

499
00:48:44,925 --> 00:48:49,415
If only they would let us in
on their secrets.

500
00:49:10,670 --> 00:49:13,290
You still do not know her master?

501
00:49:16,165 --> 00:49:17,850
Her name was Ma Gui, was it?

502
00:49:17,850 --> 00:49:20,100
Yes, sir. Though we have tailed her,

503
00:49:20,100 --> 00:49:22,860
she acts as both spy,
and traveling entertainer.

504
00:49:22,860 --> 00:49:27,600
Then why is her master yet a mystery?

505
00:49:27,600 --> 00:49:32,975
She visits a plethora of locals and places.

506
00:49:32,975 --> 00:49:35,445
We cannot trace who exactly she serves.

507
00:49:36,755 --> 00:49:41,400
Perhaps she has noticed your presence,
and is leading you astray?

508
00:49:41,400 --> 00:49:43,210
I do not believe so.

509
00:49:46,750 --> 00:49:49,130
Allow her to roam a while longer.

510
00:49:51,370 --> 00:49:57,140
A third-rate spy
will leave a trail in due time.

511
00:50:07,400 --> 00:50:08,920
Ma Gui.

512
00:50:10,140 --> 00:50:11,480
Shi Qian.

513
00:50:11,480 --> 00:50:15,255
You failed to notice my presence.

514
00:50:15,255 --> 00:50:17,855
Why have you tailed me?

515
00:50:19,190 --> 00:50:22,830
I have a message from Sir Song Jiang.

516
00:50:37,705 --> 00:50:39,030
I will write a reply.

517
00:50:39,030 --> 00:50:42,355
He said that will not be necessary.

518
00:50:42,355 --> 00:50:44,645
Then I shall go to him directly.

519
00:50:46,285 --> 00:50:47,400
Calm yourself.

520
00:50:47,400 --> 00:50:51,830
I have served him with my life. So why...

521
00:50:51,830 --> 00:50:54,560
You failed to notice my presence
till I called out.

522
00:50:54,560 --> 00:50:56,730
You are unable to suppress your emotions,

523
00:50:56,730 --> 00:51:01,600
and speak loudly of our secrets.

524
00:51:01,600 --> 00:51:07,690
Can you truly call yourself a spy
worthy of protecting Song Jiang's vision?

525
00:51:07,690 --> 00:51:13,155
If you will put Song Jiang in danger,
then I must silence you.

526
00:51:13,155 --> 00:51:15,375
Do not make me take such an extreme.

527
00:51:35,005 --> 00:51:38,450
I am excused from the Imperial Guard?

528
00:51:38,450 --> 00:51:40,660
Why?

529
00:51:44,395 --> 00:51:47,750
Allow me to see the Emperor!

530
00:51:47,750 --> 00:51:50,660
- There has to be some mistake!
- Please go back.

531
00:51:53,455 --> 00:51:55,250
Why?

532
00:51:55,250 --> 00:51:58,750
Emperor, sir!

533
00:52:00,495 --> 00:52:01,790
Again!

534
00:52:01,790 --> 00:52:04,900
Heave-ho!

535
00:52:04,900 --> 00:52:06,480
Put your backs into it!

536
00:52:06,480 --> 00:52:12,580
This flag depicts our ambitions.
It is only obvious it would be heavy!

537
00:52:12,580 --> 00:52:14,735
Chao Gai, we shall handle this!

538
00:52:14,735 --> 00:52:17,395
Heave-ho!

539
00:52:20,120 --> 00:52:22,880
Pull!

540
00:52:23,550 --> 00:52:25,800
Pull!

541
00:52:52,980 --> 00:52:56,450
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

542
00:53:01,160 --> 00:53:03,800
Doctor! Doctor!

543
00:53:05,020 --> 00:53:06,390
Look!

544
00:53:22,455 --> 00:53:24,520
Do not rest.

545
00:53:24,520 --> 00:53:26,370
Again.

546
00:53:32,790 --> 00:53:37,520
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

547
00:53:41,930 --> 00:53:45,300
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

548
00:53:47,925 --> 00:53:49,690
Go on, speak.

549
00:53:49,690 --> 00:53:52,500
Chao Gai has become the new leader.

550
00:53:52,500 --> 00:53:55,790
The fortress is now called "Mount Liang".

551
00:53:55,790 --> 00:53:57,550
Mount Liang.

552
00:53:57,550 --> 00:54:00,230
A place for those evil-doers to remain.

553
00:54:00,230 --> 00:54:02,160
Or something of the sort.

554
00:54:02,160 --> 00:54:04,900
Then they have established their perch.

555
00:54:04,900 --> 00:54:08,190
Now to see how it will grow.

556
00:54:08,190 --> 00:54:13,355
All their pieces will gather there.

557
00:54:13,355 --> 00:54:16,075
Damn it all...

558
00:54:22,575 --> 00:54:24,500
Your sleeves, they are stained.

559
00:54:24,500 --> 00:54:28,000
My apologies, sir. I am but a clumsy man.

560
00:54:31,560 --> 00:54:33,924
Our fight is not over.

561
00:54:33,924 --> 00:54:35,434
Pardon?

562
00:54:38,310 --> 00:54:40,540
"Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name".

563
00:54:41,665 --> 00:54:44,480
The author for this script remains at large.

564
00:54:44,480 --> 00:54:46,310
You mean it is not Chao Gai?

565
00:54:46,310 --> 00:54:48,730
How can that be?

566
00:54:48,730 --> 00:54:52,850
Chao Gai is a cunning, pragmatic man.

567
00:54:52,850 --> 00:54:57,506
Yet this author has a child's heart.

568
00:54:57,506 --> 00:55:02,756
He undoubtedly believes
in his idealistic dreams.

569
00:55:04,100 --> 00:55:08,140
It seems you have an idea who this author is.

570
00:55:30,310 --> 00:55:32,250
Mother?

571
00:55:38,900 --> 00:55:40,580
Po Xi...

572
00:55:46,950 --> 00:55:49,660
Mother?

573
00:55:56,265 --> 00:55:58,770
Make a report to Wang He.

574
00:55:58,770 --> 00:56:01,715
Ma Gui has a daughter.

575
00:56:01,715 --> 00:56:05,355
Her name is Po Xi.

576
00:56:46,990 --> 00:56:48,040
You fool!

577
00:56:48,040 --> 00:56:50,060
The leader cannot go
and put himself in danger.

578
00:56:50,060 --> 00:56:51,730
That is how I establish a country.

579
00:56:51,730 --> 00:56:53,110
No emperor would do such a thing!

580
00:56:53,110 --> 00:56:55,400
Which is why these countries fall to ruin!

581
00:56:55,400 --> 00:56:57,831
You will abandon a mere child?

582
00:56:57,831 --> 00:57:00,810
Brother, you are more than a mere clerk.

583
00:57:00,810 --> 00:57:02,400
I am certain you are hiding something.

584
00:57:02,400 --> 00:57:04,410
I entrust my back to you, Yang Zhi.

585
00:57:04,410 --> 00:57:05,520
Mount Erlong.

586
00:57:05,520 --> 00:57:07,190
Lead a group of bandits, you say?

587
00:57:07,190 --> 00:57:10,590
Will you become a bandit yourself?

588
00:57:10,590 --> 00:57:12,770
We do away with rotten officials,

589
00:57:12,770 --> 00:57:15,650
and extinguish all embers of a revolution.

590
00:57:15,650 --> 00:57:17,910
Would you please become this child's mother?

591
00:57:17,910 --> 00:57:20,270
You have a daughter, named Yan Po Xi.

592
00:57:20,270 --> 00:57:21,730
We will bring her misery.

593
00:57:21,730 --> 00:57:24,695
Song Jiang!

594
00:57:24,695 --> 00:57:28,105
The fault is mine alone to bear.

595
00:59:11,070 --> 00:59:15,820
[Episode 6 - FIN]

